\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[560px] text-[14px] leading-[1.9] text-[var(--ink-mute)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-3\">\n                        ينعقد المؤتمر في مركز البحرين الدولي للمعارض والمؤتمرات، مع معرض مصاحب على مساحة 4,000 م² وقاعتين للجلسات المتوازية.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"border-r-2 border-[var(--gold)] bg-[var(--canvas-soft)] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-[var(--ink-faint)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-1\">\n                            الجهة المستضيفة\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 font-display text-[15px] font-bold text-[var(--indigo)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-2\">\n                            جمعية المهندسين البحرينية\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border-r-2 border-[var(--gold)] bg-[var(--canvas-soft)] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-[var(--ink-faint)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1\">\n                            الشريك المهني\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 font-display text-[15px] font-bold text-[var(--indigo)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-2\">\n                            اتحاد المهندسين الخليجيين\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[var(--teal)] py-16 text-white sm:py-20\" data-kid=\"1-2-7\" id=\"contact\">\n            <div class=\"dark-grid absolute inset-0 opacity-25\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative mx-auto flex max-w-[960px] flex-col items-center px-6 text-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2\">\n                <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--gold-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-1\">\n                    شراكة استراتيجية\n                </p>\n                <h2 class=\"arabic-heading mt-4 text-[28px] text-white sm:text-[39px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2\">\n                    اطلب ملف الشراكة لهذا المؤتمر\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[630px] text-[14px] leading-[1.9] text-white/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-3\">\n                    تعرّف على فرص الظهور، الباقات، ومسارات الشراكة في مؤتمر ومعرض إدارة الطاقة — الملتقى الهندسي الخليجي 26.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-4\">\n                    <a class=\"inline-flex min-h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-[var(--violet)] px-6 text-[14px] font-bold text-[var(--indigo)] hover:bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-4-1\" href=\"mailto:events@bse.bh\">\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-sm ti ti-file-description\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-4-1-1\">\n                        </span>\n                        اطلب ملف الشراكة لهذا المؤتمر\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"inline-flex min-h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-white/45 px-6 text-[14px] font-bold text-white hover:bg-white/10\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-4-2\" href=\"mailto:events@bse.bh\">\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-sm ti ti-mail\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-4-2-1\">\n                        </span>\n                        تواصل مع الفريق\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-[var(--indigo-deep)] py-8 text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1120px] flex-col gap-3 px-6 text-[12px] text-white/55 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\">\n            <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\">\n                © 2025 BSE Event — جمعية المهندسين البحرينية\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\">\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-sm ti ti-phone text-[var(--gold-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\">\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\" dir=\"ltr\">\n                    +973 1772 7100\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"mx-1 text-white/25\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3\">\n                    ·\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-4\">\n                    events@bse.bh\n                </span>\n            </span>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n<script>\n    (() => {\n    const tabs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.schedule-tab'));\n    const panels = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.schedule-panel'));\n    tabs.forEach((tab) => {\n      tab.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const day = tab.getAttribute('data-day');\n        tabs.forEach((item) => {\n          const active = item === tab;\n          item.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(active));\n          item.classList.toggle('tab-active', active);\n          item.classList.toggle('tab-idle', !active);\n        });\n        panels.forEach((panel) => {\n          panel.hidden = panel.getAttribute('data-panel') !== day;\n        });\n      });\n    });\n  })();\n</script>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-09-01T07:17:37.668162+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-09-01T07:19:31.338396+00:00",
