             </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-[#e8e4dd] pt-3 lg:block lg:border-t-0 lg:pt-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-6-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-[#6d6965]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-6-3-1\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-map-pin text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-6-3-1-1\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#d3a53e;\">\n                                </i>\n                                مقر الجمعية، الجفير\n                            </div>\n                            <a class=\"mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-[#102a66] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold text-[#102a66] hover:bg-[#102a66] hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-6-3-2\" href=\"/events/young-engineers-forum\">\n                                افتح صفحة البرنامج\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-left text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-3-6-3-2-1\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;color:currentColor;\">\n                                </i>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hidden border border-dashed border-[#d3a53e] bg-white px-6 py-12 text-center\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-4\" data-name=\"empty search state container\" data-reason=\"visibility toggled by script based on result count\" id=\"emptyState\">\n                    <span class=\"icon-box mx-auto\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-4-1\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-search-off text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-4-1-1\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;color:#102a66;\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                    <h3 class=\"display-font mt-4 text-[20px] font-bold text-[#102a66]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-4-2\">\n                        لا توجد نتائج مطابقة\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] text-[#6d6965]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-4-3\">\n                        جرّب كلمة بحث مختلفة أو أعد ضبط الفلاتر.\n                    </p>\n                    <button class=\"mt-5 rounded-md bg-[#102a66] px-4 py-3 text-[12px] font-bold text-white hover:bg-[#071b45]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-4-4\" id=\"clearFilters\" type=\"button\">\n                        مسح الفلاتر\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"bg-[#0e3030] px-6 py-16 text-white lg:px-8 lg:py-20\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" id=\"contact\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1180px] flex-col items-start justify-between gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[12px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#f0d48a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1\">\n                        شراكة تبدأ بفكرة\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"display-font mt-3 max-w-[690px] text-[32px] font-bold leading-tight text-white sm:text-[42px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2\">\n                        هل لديك فكرة نشاط أو ندوة؟\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[620px] text-[14px] leading-[1.9] text-white/68\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-3\">\n                        نستقبل مقترحات الأعضاء واللجان الفنية والشركات لتنظيم فعاليات تصنع أثرًا واضحًا للمجتمع الهندسي.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <a class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-white px-5 py-3.5 text-[14px] font-bold text-[#0e3030] hover:bg-[#f0d48a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\" href=\"mailto:events@bse.bh\">\n                    اقترح فعالية\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-left text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;color:#0e3030;\">\n                    </i>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"bg-[#071b45] px-6 py-12 text-white lg:px-8\" data-kid=\"1-3\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1180px] gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_0.8fr_1fr]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\">\n            <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\">\n                    <img alt=\"شعار جمعية المهندسين البحرينية\" class=\"size-11 rounded-full bg-white object-contain p-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/favicon.png\" width=\"44\"/>\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2\">\n                        <p class=\"display-font text-[19px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2-1\">\n                            BSE Event\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-white/60\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2-2\">\n                            جمعية المهندسين البحرينية\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[430px] text-[13px] leading-[1.9] text-white/62\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\">\n                    قسم إدارة الفعاليات والمؤتمرات والمعارض — نبني منصات هندسية تجمع الرعاة والعارضين والحضور في مكان واحد.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold text-[#f0d48a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\">\n                    روابط سريعة\n                </h3>\n                <ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2 text-[13px] text-white/68\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\">\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1-1\" href=\"#about\">\n                            من نحن\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-1\" href=\"#conferences\">\n                            المؤتمرات\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3-1\" href=\"#events\">\n                            الفعاليات\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-4\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-4-1\" href=\"#sponsors\">\n                            الرعاة\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-3\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-bold text-[#f0d48a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-1\">\n                    تواصل معنا\n                </h3>\n                <ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-[13px] text-white/68\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-1\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-map-pin text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-1-1\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#f0d48a;\">\n                        </i>\n                        مبنى الجمعية، الجفير، مملكة البحرين\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-2\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-phone text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-2-1\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#f0d48a;\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-2-2\" dir=\"ltr\">\n                            +973 1772 7100\n                        </span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-3\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-mail text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-3-1\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:#f0d48a;\">\n                        </i>\n                        events@bse.bh\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mx-auto mt-10 max-w-[1180px] border-t border-white/12 pt-5 text-center text-[11px] text-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\">\n            © 2026 BSE Event — جميع الحقوق محفوظة لجمعية المهندسين البحرينية\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n<script>\n    (() => {\n    const rows = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.event-row'));\n    const tabs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.filter-tab'));\n    const search = document.getElementById('eventSearch');\n    const category = document.getElementById('categorySelect');\n    const count = document.getElementById('resultCount');\n    const empty = document.getElementById('emptyState');\n    const clear = document.getElementById('clearFilters');\n    let activeStatus = 'all';\n\n    const applyFilters = () => {\n      const query = (search.value || '').trim().toLowerCase();\n      const selectedCategory = category.value;\n      let visible = 0;\n      rows.forEach((row) => {\n        const show = (activeStatus === 'all' || row.dataset.status === activeStatus) && (selectedCategory === 'all' || row.dataset.category === selectedCategory) && (!query || (row.dataset.search || '').toLowerCase().includes(query));\n        row.classList.toggle('is-hidden', !show);\n        if (show) visible += 1;\n      });\n      count.textContent = visible + ' نتائج';\n      empty.classList.toggle('hidden', visible !== 0);\n    };\n\n    tabs.forEach((tab) => {\n      tab.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        activeStatus = tab.dataset.status || 'all';\n        tabs.forEach((item) => {\n          const selected = item === tab;\n          item.classList.toggle('bg-[#102a66]', selected);\n          item.classList.toggle('text-white', selected);\n          item.classList.toggle('font-bold', selected);\n          item.classList.toggle('text-[#6d6965]', !selected);\n          item.classList.toggle('font-semibold', !selected);\n        });\n        applyFilters();\n      });\n    });\n\n    search.addEventListener('input', applyFilters);\n    category.addEventListener('change', applyFilters);\n    clear.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      search.value = '';\n      category.value = 'all';\n      activeStatus = 'all';\n      tabs.forEach((item, index) => {\n        const selected = index === 0;\n        item.classList.toggle('bg-[#102a66]', selected);\n        item.classList.toggle('text-white', selected);\n        item.classList.toggle('font-bold', selected);\n        item.classList.toggle('text-[#6d6965]', !selected);\n        item.classList.toggle('font-semibold', !selected);\n      });\n      applyFilters();\n    });\n  })();\n</script>\n",
